{"4810070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CONCRETE BURIAL", "steam_appid": 4810070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thou art a Knight of the Crimson Clan on a perilous quest into ancient catacombs known as The Whispering Crypt.<br><br> Equipped only with a weapon that consumes your blood, thou must face what the unknown darkness holds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810070/extras/7396500e3d75a40cda2c944667531ac4.poster.avif?t=1787242500\" width=716 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810070/extras/7396500e3d75a40cda2c944667531ac4.webm?t=1787242500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810070/extras/7396500e3d75a40cda2c944667531ac4.mp4?t=1787242500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legend proclaims any who complete the trials and collect the four Artifacts of Desire shall be granted their irrefutable wish. <i>However</i>… none have yet returned alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will <i>you</i>?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONCRETE BURIAL </strong>is a short, first-person horror game designed to be completed in a single sitting of 1-2 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810070/extras/469f2b0dad3ae23c72f29a73e1376b2e.poster.avif?t=1787242500\" width=716 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810070/extras/469f2b0dad3ae23c72f29a73e1376b2e.webm?t=1787242500\" type=\"vid