paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONCRETE BURIAL </strong>is a short, first-person horror game designed to be completed in a single sitting of 1-2 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810070/extras/469f2b0dad3ae23c72f29a73e1376b2e.poster.avif?t=1787242500\" width=716 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810070/extras/469f2b0dad3ae23c72f29a73e1376b2e.webm?t=1787242500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810070/extras/469f2b0dad3ae23c72f29a73e1376b2e.mp4?t=1787242500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a weapon that uses your own blood as ammunition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Catacombs full of brutalist architecture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the ancient entity that is always watching</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive each of the four uniquely designed trials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Speedrun Mode after completing the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Equipped only with a weapon that consumes your own blood, explore an ancient brutalist catacomb. Beware the Eyes of The Whispering Crypt. Find the 4 artifacts of desire. Confront God.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810070/31be922da1b9dd7dcc3f0a6d79109ecfbcd0e2a2/header.jpg?t=1787242500", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810070/15bf80054a66ab86f445ca53b04e3105ec563f82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787242500", "capsule_imagev5": "https